{
  "id": "E291",
  "title": "Watching A Movie Alone",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2019-01-19",
  "synopsis": "Ben can’t find anyone to go watch a movie with him.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/947/c5c48d5d1ddd5d7bd185102c357ac7f55e0d5192.mp3?1547295337",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "一个人看电影\n\n本：小乐，我买了两张明天的电影票，你想不想去看？\n小乐：不好意思，我明天要去看我奶奶。你问一下保罗吧。\n本：保罗明天有事，也不能去。\n小乐：丽丽呢？\n本：丽丽身体不舒服，她想在家休息。\n小乐：那你问问别的同学吧。\n本：算了，我还是一个人去看吧。",
    "traditional": "一個人看電影\n\n本：小樂，我買了兩張明天的電影票，你想不想去看？\n小樂：不好意思，我明天要去看我奶奶。你問一下保羅吧。\n本：保羅明天有事，也不能去。\n小樂：麗麗呢？\n本：麗麗身體不舒服，她想在家休息。\n小樂：那你問問別的同學吧。\n本：算了，我還是一個人去看吧。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Watching A Movie Alone"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：小乐，我买了两张明天的电影票，你想不想去看？",
      "traditional": "本：小樂，我買了兩張明天的電影票，你想不想去看？",
      "pinyin": "běn xiǎo lè wǒ mǎi le liǎng zhāng míng tiān de diàn yǐng piào nǐ xiǎng bù xiǎng qù kàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Little Le, I bought two tickets for the movie tomorrow. Do you want to go watch it together?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小乐：不好意思，我明天要去看我奶奶。你问一下保罗吧。",
      "traditional": "小樂：不好意思，我明天要去看我奶奶。你問一下保羅吧。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè bù hǎo yì si wǒ míng tiān yào qù kàn wǒ nǎi nai nǐ wèn yí xià bǎo luó ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Sorry, I’m going to visit my grandma tomorrow. You can ask Paul."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：保罗明天有事，也不能去。",
      "traditional": "本：保羅明天有事，也不能去。",
      "pinyin": "běn bǎo luó míng tiān yǒu shì yě bù néng qù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Paul is busy tomorrow. He can’t go either."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小乐：丽丽呢？",
      "traditional": "小樂：麗麗呢？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè lì lì ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: How about Lili?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "本：丽丽身体不舒服，她想在家休息。",
      "traditional": "本：麗麗身體不舒服，她想在家休息。",
      "pinyin": "běn lì lì shēn tǐ bù shū fu tā xiǎng zài jiā xiū xi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Lili isn’t feeling well. She wants to stay at home and rest."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小乐：那你问问别的同学吧。",
      "traditional": "小樂：那你問問別的同學吧。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nà nǐ wèn wen bié de tóng xué ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Then ask some other classmate."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "本：算了，我还是一个人去看吧。",
      "traditional": "本：算了，我還是一個人去看吧。",
      "pinyin": "běn suàn le wǒ hái shi yí ge rén qù kàn ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Never mind, I better just go watch it alone."
    }
  ],
